{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":14},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.28,"end":32.24},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.68,"end":40.88}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.08,"text":"在一種形狀有效的海報，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.16,"end":3.76,"text":"變窄後可能失敗。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.64,"end":6.8,"text":"格式變更是在測試層級，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.88,"end":7.84,"text":"不只是縮放。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":8.48,"end":12.16,"text":"確認標題、日期與編號區塊仍可區分，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.6,"end":14,"text":"再匯出成品。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":15.28,"end":19.68,"text":"切換格式、調整標題字級、欄數與外側留白，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.04,"end":22.08,"text":"再匯出海報 SVG。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.12,"end":24.96,"text":"檢查預定觀看尺寸下，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.24,"end":27.84,"text":"最小文字是否仍易讀。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":29.6,"end":32.24,"text":"哪個是有用的最後格式檢查？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.68,"end":33.811,"text":"哪個是有用的最後格式檢查？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.84,"end":37.68,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":38.16,"end":40.88,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}